Package: com.wilburt.oitinspector
Name: OITInspector
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Read-only runtime diagnostics for the OITUI ecosystem. Dumps window/view hierarchies and matching class names to help develop OITS, OITI, and OITG. Writes only to its own log directory -- never touches system state.
Maintainer: wilburt
Author: wilburt
Section: Development
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), com.wilburt.oitcore
